meta {
  name: List users
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admins/users?status=ongoing&page=1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  status: ongoing
  page: 1
  ~search_term: สมชาย
  ~request_type: 3
}

docs {
  Admin login (cookie Authentication_Admin): run "Admin auth / Login" first. Users of the admin's organization and below. `status`: `ongoing`, `activated` or `suspended`. Optional `request_type` (1-11, otherwise 400) keeps users whose latest Status History entry has that Request Type. Each row has `request_type` and `request_type_name` of the user's latest entry.
}
